# variation 1 of b14: the right call: two arguments, then one (D-133)
** spec: semantics/aspects.md#what-an-aspect-is
driver b14_test1 is
  process main is
    apply greet("Eve", "Hi");
    apply greet("Bob");
  return;
end b14_test1;
